<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Youtube on Saitech</title><link>https://saiphe.com/tags/youtube/</link><description>Recent content in Youtube on Saitech</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 18 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://saiphe.com/tags/youtube/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>ytDownloader</title><link>https://saiphe.com/p/ytdownloader/</link><pubDate>Sat, 18 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://saiphe.com/p/ytdownloader/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://saiphe.com/p/ytdownloader/1.png" alt="Featured image of post ytDownloader" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;For years I was using online solutions to download music from YouTube… not anymore. This simple GUI solves all my issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can download it directly from the &lt;b&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/aandrew-me/ytDownloader" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;Github page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;or if you’re on Arch Linux, just run this in your terminal:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;flatpak install flathub io.github.aandrew_me.ytdn
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Using it is so much easier than trying to describe it, so… go figure it out yourself 😁&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://saiphe.com/p/ytdownloader/2.jpg"
width="3176"
height="1825"
srcset="https://saiphe.com/p/ytdownloader/2_hu_fb4c3b060d34b12f.jpg 480w, https://saiphe.com/p/ytdownloader/2_hu_2192be121b15e244.jpg 1024w"
loading="lazy"
alt="ytDownloader"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="174"
data-flex-basis="417px"
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>YouTube Video Finder</title><link>https://saiphe.com/p/youtube-video-finder/</link><pubDate>Tue, 25 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://saiphe.com/p/youtube-video-finder/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://saiphe.com/p/youtube-video-finder/2.png" alt="Featured image of post YouTube Video Finder" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have you ever felt that sinking feeling when you see &lt;code&gt;&amp;quot;This video has been deleted&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt; in a YouTube playlist, and you have no idea what it was? Was it a video you loved or just something you wouldn’t miss?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Either way, not knowing can be frustrating.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This tool helps you identify the title of deleted YouTube videos so you can:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Search for alternative uploads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find similar content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Or simply know what you’ve lost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check it out here:&lt;b&gt; &lt;a class="link" href="https://findyoutubevideo.thetechrobo.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;https://findyoutubevideo.thetechrobo.ca/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>YT-X</title><link>https://saiphe.com/p/yt-x/</link><pubDate>Wed, 18 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://saiphe.com/p/yt-x/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://saiphe.com/p/yt-x/2024-12-19_01-32.png" alt="Featured image of post YT-X" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;What else is there to say? You can easily browse YouTube videos right from the terminal&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="source"&gt;Source
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get it from &lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/Benexl/yt-x" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;this&lt;/a&gt; repo made by Benexl&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="installation"&gt;Installation
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;# for paru users
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;paru -S yt-x-git
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;# for yay users
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;yay -S yt-x-git
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="basic-commands"&gt;Basic commands
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;# launch the ui
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;yt-x
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;# edit your config
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;yt-x -e
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>